# Generated Gaussian splat binaries.
# Captures are large and regenerable; real surveys belong in release assets or
# an external bucket, per the $0 bandwidth rule in CLAUDE.md. Regenerate the
# synthetic stand-in with:
#   python3 scripts/cleanup_splat.py --synthesize <path>
*.splat
*.ply
models/sam2/

# Downloaded GDTF fixture profiles.
# Archives run to tens of megabytes each and are redistributable only under
# GDTF Share's terms, so the cache is a local artifact rather than repository
# content. Repopulate it with:
#   GDTF_SHARE_USER=... GDTF_SHARE_PASSWORD=... npm run fetch:gdtf
public/assets/fixtures/cache/
*.gdtf

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
